Hero does not die. Converts fatal damage into unconsciousness without death, allowing ironman gameplay.

[b]Features:[/b]
- Instant damage interception at 1 HP, preventing game over.
- 2-second ground knockdown followed by seamless recovery animation.
- Configurable post-knockdown invincibility grace period (default: 20 seconds).
- Full protection against scripted instant-death triggers and max HP reduction traps.
- Clean facial expressions and neutral face state restoration.

[b]Configuration:[/b]
Edit [b]zHeroDontDie.d[/b] to customize timers:
[code]
// Configurable Hero Invincibility Grace Period (in seconds after standing up):
const int z_HeroCooldownSeconds = 20;

// Configurable Hero Knockdown Duration on ground (in seconds, Hero only):
const int z_HeroDownDurationSeconds = 2;
[/code]

[b]Notes & Known Minor Nuance:[/b]
When knocked down by beasts/monsters using natural weapons (teeth/claws), peaceful item/chest crosshair focus temporarily stays in combat stance. Simply cycle your weapon once (press [b]1[/b] to draw and [b]1[/b] to sheathe) to return to peacetime interaction focus.

